we'll get into a little bit

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:48.917
here shortly.

00:06:48.917 --> 00:06:51.250
We have to provision that
infrastructure well in advance

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.700
and then it just sits
around all the time.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.590
It's just kind of sitting there.

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:55.150
Even with
virtualization, we still

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:59.050
have to provision that
infrastructure well in advance.

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:01.840
LUKE STONE: So how did that
work this year, like when

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:05.980
you actually had to face doing
Black Friday on public cloud

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.450
